# Paths Nx must not crawl.
#
# `.worktrees` is load-bearing: Nx walks worktree checkouts and fails lint on duplicate
# project names without it (learned 2026-09-01).
#
# This file previously began with a UTF-8 BOM, which became part of the FIRST pattern —
# so the rule read "\ufeff.claude", not ".claude", and never matched. Written without a BOM.
.claude
.codex
archive
.worktrees

# Spire's cluster project.json made Nx register a stray `tech` project. Only that file is ignored,
# so the .spire files the Rust tests read stay hashed as api:test inputs.
.spire/**/project.json
